weapons":[],"profile":{"Age":[134],"Height":[162],"Weight":[46]},"tribes":["精灵"],"story":"利娅，反偷猎者，保护坎特伯雷森林的精灵弓箭手。\n\n没人知道她来自何方，是从什么时候开始守护森林的。利娅路过坎特伯雷森林时发现猎杀动物、砍伐树木的偷猎者之后，开始一一阻止，自然而然就在森林定居下来了。经常碰到入侵森林的偷猎者。因此，认为人类在所有族群中品性最恶劣，自私且贪婪。","storyKey":"profile_elf_archer_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=199","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=199","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"elf_archer","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["为什么大家都不懂得珍惜大自然？"],"enUS":["Why doesn't anyone realize the importance of nature?"],"jaJP":["どうして皆、自然の大切さが分からないのでしょう？"]},"keys":["Voice_elf_archer_1_TouchReactionGood1"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"1990031"},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["听到了吗？刚才那棵树和你打招呼。"],"enUS":["Did you hear that? That tree just said hi to you."],"jaJP":["今、あの木があなたに挨拶しましたよ、聞こえましたよね？"]},"keys":["Voice_elf_archer_1_TouchReactionGood2"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"1990032"},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["人类…人类总是在破坏大自然。"],"enUS":["Humans... humans always destroy nature."],"jaJP":["人間は、いつも自然を破壊します"]},"keys":["Voice_elf_archer_1_TouchReactionBad1"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"1990033"},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["偷猎者真可恶。"],"enUS":["Poachers are really horrible."],"jaJP":["密猟者は本当に残酷です"]},"keys":["Voice_elf_archer_1_TouchReactionBad2"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"1990034"},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["收到新邮件，快打开看看。"],"enUS":["There's new mail. Check it."],"jaJP":["新しい手紙が来ましたね、確認してみてください"]},"keys":["Voice_e